## Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Huỳnh Thế Long",
  "phone": "0888703040",
  "password": "Pass123@",
  "email": "longhuynh@fubabus.com"
}
###
## Register - duplicate phone (expect 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Huỳnh Thế Long",
  "phone": "0888703040",
  "password": "Pass123@",
  "email": "longhuynh2@fubabus.com"
}
###
## Register - invalid phone format (expect 400, fails @Pattern validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Phone",
  "phone": "12345",
  "password": "Pass123@",
  "email": "invalid@fubabus.com"
}
###
## Login - captures accessToken/refreshToken for the requests below
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0888703040",
  "password": "Pass123@"
}
###
## Login - wrong password (expect 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0888703040",
  "password": "WrongPass123@"
}
###
## Login - unknown phone (expect 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "0999999999",
  "password": "Pass123@"
}
###
## Refresh - exchange refresh token for a new access token (rotates the refresh token)
# @name refresh
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}
###
## Refresh - invalid/expired token (expect 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "not-a-real-refresh-token"
}
###
## Logout - revokes the refresh token (expect 204 No Content)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}
